6. e3 { This solid move defends the bishop on f4 and prepares to develop the light-squared bishop. } 6... c5 { Black challenges White's central control immediately. } 7. dxc5 { White takes the c5-pawn. } (7. cxd5 Nxd5 8. Be5 Nxc3 9. bxc3 Bxe5 10. Nxe5 Nd7 { is very nice for Black. }) (7. Be2 cxd4 8. exd4 (8. Nxd4 dxc4 9. Bxc4 Qa5 { is good for Black }) 8... dxc4 9. Bxc4 Bg4 { is a good position for Black. }) 7... Ne4 { Aiming to take on c5. } 8. Rc1 { Bringing the rook to the c-file, where it is most active. } (8. Be5 { has also been played here. } 8... Bxe5 9. Nxe5 Nxc3 10. bxc3 Qa5 { is nice for Black. }) (8. Nxe4 dxe4 { is very good for Black. For example: } 9. Qxd8 (9. Nd4 e5 { just wins a piece }) (9. Nd2 Na6 { going after the c5-pawn while still eyeing b2 is very good for Black. }) 9... Rxd8 10. Nd4 e5 { wins a Rook for two pieces after } 11. Bg5 f6 12. Nb5 fxg5 13. Nc7 Na6 14. Nxa8 Be6 { where Black is better. }) 8... Nd7 { Black develops the knight and is ready to take on c5. } 9. cxd5 { White takes on d5, removing the defense of the knight on e4. } 9... Qa5 { Black pins the knight on c3, indirectly defending the e4-knight. } 10. Nd4 { White centralizes their knight and blocks the combined attack against the knight on c3. } 10... Nxc3 { Black takes on c3. } 11. bxc3 { White recaptures. } 11... Qxa2 { The trade has left the pawn on a2 without any defense. } 12. c6 { White tries to create a passed pawn to give Black some trouble. } 12... Nc5 { Black brings the knight to the active c5-square. } 13. Be2 { White prepares to get the bishop to the long diagonal. } (13. c4 Qa5+ { is good for Black because } 14. Qd2 Qxd2+ 15. Kxd2 e5 { and now } (15... Bxd4 16. exd4 Nb3+ 17. Kc3 Nxc1 18. Bxc1 { is great for White due to the threatening pawns, despite Black's material edge }) 16. dxe6 fxe6 { continues pressure against White. }) 13... Qxd5 { Black takes the d5-pawn, restoring the material balance. } 14. Bf3 { Challenging the queen on the h1-a8 diagonal. } 14... Qc4 { Placing the queen on the active c4-square. } 15. Be2 { continuing to harass the queen. } 15... Qa2 { Black has a good position. } *


