7. O-O O-O { Here there are two options for White. } 8. Nc3 (8. Ne5 { is possible. I like } 8... Nbd7 9. Nc3 e6 { which gives Black a very solid position. } 10. f4 a6 11. a4 b6 12. b3 Bb7 { is fine for Black. }) 8... b6 { We have transposed to a line in the 7. Nc3 chapter. } *


